### Tes API dengan ekstensi "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) di VS Code
@host = http://localhost:3000

GET {{host}}/api/health

###
GET {{host}}/api/reports

###
GET {{host}}/api/stats?hours=24

###
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Content-Type: application/json
# x-api-key: ISI_JIKA_API_KEY_AKTIF

{ "jenis": "pencurian", "lat": -7.2575, "lng": 112.7452, "no_pelanggan": "PLG-123456" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/import
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "append", "rows": [ { "id_meter": "MTR-1", "jenis": "hilang", "lat": -7.30, "lng": 112.74, "waktu_lapor": "2026-10-23T07:30:00" } ] }
